'''Candy Corn''' is a [[common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[Halloween Event 2017#Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2017|2017 Halloween Event]].  It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade takes the design of a piece of candy corn, hence the name. It starts at white on the tip that gradually fades into an orange near the center, which then fades into a yellow at the heel. The guard is orange, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia==
*Its model, published by [[Nikilis]], can be found [https://www.roblox.com/library/1133337797/CandyCorn here].

